  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened institutional capacity of employers&apos; organizations</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ILO&#x2019;s strategy will focus on supporting GCCI in establishing a research and communication unit which will meet the needs of its members for informative products and also developing its capacity to conduct advocacy activities based on analysis of the business environment that reflect the views of its private sector members. Assistance will be provided to produce information and research papers on the state of the economy with a keen focus on the prevailing issues at the time. These position papers will be published on a periodic basis to share the private sector perspective on private sector development issues and influence policies. GCCI staff will benefit from training and mentoring in order to ensure sustainability of the service. The ILO will also support specific advocacy initiatives targeting government and other partners in fora such as the National Economic Council meetings or the Labour advisory board . The mains outputs are:
&#x2022;	Enhanced capacity of GCCI to conduct research and advocacy
&#x2022;	Research and communication products available
&#x2022;	Dissemination activities and advocacy conducted</narrative>
  </description>
